{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.97,"lines":[{"text":"Charles le bon on the beat (yeah)","t":2.48,"e":23.5,"w":[["Charles",2.48,2.76],["le",9.58,9.66],["bon",17.6,17.84],["on",21.78,22],["the",22.11,22.31],["beat",22.22,22.78],["yeah",23.32,23.5]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"Yeah...","t":24.68,"e":24.84,"w":[["Yeah",24.68,24.84]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"The energy is rising.","t":25.26,"e":26.74,"w":[["The",25.26,25.38],["energy",25.46,26.06],["is",26.12,26.26],["rising",26.34,26.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Soleil dans le cœur, rage dans les veines.","t":28,"e":30.42,"w":[["Soleil",28,28.3],["dans",28.36,28.46],["le",28.5,28.58],["cœur",28.66,28.82],["rage",29.12,29.52],["dans",29.56,29.72],["les",29.76,29.9],["veines",30.02,30.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Let’s go.","t":31.14,"e":31.68,"w":[["Let’s",31.14,31.32],["go",31.42,31.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai la rage, j’ai la dalle, je vise le sommet,","t":33.4,"e":36.88,"w":[["J’ai",33.4,33.52],["la",33.58,33.66],["rage",33.74,33.94],["j’ai",34.34,34.46],["la",34.5,34.6],["dalle",34.66,34.88],["je",35.86,36],["vise",36.04,36.2],["le",36.36,36.44],["sommet",36.5,36.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Success is calling me, je n'ai jamais sommeil.","t":37.14,"e":40.58,"w":[["Success",37.14,37.6],["is",37.64,37.82],["calling",37.88,38.24],["me",38.32,38.72],["je",39.4,39.5],["n'ai",39.54,39.68],["jamais",39.74,40.12],["sommeil",40.22,40.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"I no de wait, je fonce, je crée mon destin,","t":40.68,"e":42.9,"w":[["I",40.68,40.74],["no",40.78,40.9],["de",41.07,41.27],["wait",41.23,41.43],["je",41.4,41.5],["fonce",41.58,41.8],["je",41.86,41.96],["crée",42,42.16],["mon",42.24,42.42],["destin",42.48,42.9]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"On the beat, j'suis le roi, je trace mon chemin.","t":43.38,"e":46.6,"w":[["On",43.38,43.58],["the",43.86,44.06],["beat",44.34,44.52],["j'suis",44.74,44.94],["le",45,45.18],["roi",45.26,45.48],["je",45.56,45.66],["trace",45.7,45.92],["mon",45.96,46.12],["chemin",46.16,46.6]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"Tristesse derrière, soleil dans les yeux,","t":48.02,"e":49.68,"w":[["Tristesse",48.02,48.3],["derrière",48.34,48.68],["soleil",48.8,49.08],["dans",49.12,49.22],["les",49.26,49.42],["yeux",49.46,49.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"I'm shining brighter, reaching for the heavens, for God.","t":49.9,"e":52.52,"w":[["I'm",49.9,49.98],["shining",50.02,50.3],["brighter",50.32,50.6],["reaching",50.82,51.2],["for",51.28,51.4],["the",51.44,51.52],["heavens",51.72,51.98],["for",52.02,52.14],["God",52.22,52.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pidgin flow, French touch, tout est mélangé,","t":52.8,"e":55.24,"w":[["Pidgin",52.8,53.0],["flow",53.08,53.26],["French",53.56,53.8],["touch",54.04,54.26],["tout",54.34,54.5],["est",54.52,54.62],["mélangé",54.68,55.24]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"Dans le club, dans la rue, le game est changé.","t":56.06,"e":58.96,"w":[["Dans",56.06,56.16],["le",56.2,56.32],["club",56.38,56.66],["dans",56.82,56.94],["la",57,57.1],["rue",57.28,57.64],["le",58.04,58.14],["game",58.18,58.34],["est",58.38,58.46],["changé",58.48,58.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Soleil, sunshine, brille dans ma vie,","t":59.56,"e":62.56,"w":[["Soleil",59.56,59.92],["sunshine",60.02,60.38],["brille",61.84,62],["dans",62.04,62.14],["ma",62.2,62.32],["vie",62.38,62.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Rage de réussir, je casse tous les bruits.","t":63.26,"e":66.42,"w":[["Rage",63.26,63.52],["de",63.58,63.72],["réussir",63.78,64.78],["je",64.86,64.98],["casse",65.3,65.68],["tous",65.74,65.84],["les",65.88,66],["bruits",66.04,66.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"God is my witness, I’m winning the race,","t":66.94,"e":70.04,"w":[["God",66.94,67.26],["is",67.32,67.48],["my",67.6,67.8],["witness",67.86,68.52],["I’m",68.58,68.94],["winning",69.04,69.54],["the",69.6,69.68],["race",69.76,70.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dancing to the rhythm, I set the pace.","t":70.64,"e":73.82,"w":[["Dancing",70.64,71.22],["to",71.28,71.38],["the",71.44,71.52],["rhythm",71.58,72.18],["I",72.76,73.02],["set",73.08,73.22],["the",73.26,73.38],["pace",73.44,73.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":